-line=\"40\">  rowIds[rowIdsOffset + index] = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>keys<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"communityArea\">communityArea</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>keyLow<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"group-statistics-key-low\">group-statistics-key-low</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>rowIds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"group-statistics-row-ids\">group-statistics-row-ids</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUGroupStatistics/prepare · main · 23cef4fb</figcaption></figure></section>",
